<title>USA: Arco limits Oct. Line 63 crude to 46.06 pct.</title>
<headline>Arco limits Oct. Line 63 crude to 46.06 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arco Pipeline Co set crude oil shipments on California's Line 63 at 46.06 percent of nominations for October, a company spokesman said Thursday.  </p>
<p>The apportionment fell from 46.81 percent of nominations accepted in September.</p>
<p>Daily throughput was projected at 110,000 barrels for October, up from 108,000 carried in September.</p>
<p>Shipments on the line have been limited nearly every month since a January 1994 earthquake knocked out a companion line in Los Angeles, creating a backlog.</p>
<p>A breakdown on light and heavy crude shipments was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
